# =============================================================================
# TripBlogger — monorepo (.gitignore gốc, áp dụng api + app + tooling)
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dependencies (không đẩy thư viện)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/node_modules/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets & dữ liệu cá nhân / local (KHÔNG commit)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.compose.example

# Certificates, keystores, Google/Firebase local (điều chỉnh nếu bạn chủ đích commit prod config)
**/google-services.json
**/GoogleService-Info.plist
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.jks
**/*.pfx
**/*.key
**/credentials*.json

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Logs
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/logs/
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/pnpm-debug.log*

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build & cache outputs
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/dist/
**/build/
**/uploads/
**/coverage/
**/.turbo/
**/.cache/
**/.parcel-cache/
**/.eslintcache
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Expo / React Native
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/.expo/
**/.expo-shared/
**/web-build/
**/.metro-health-check*
**/android/
**/ios/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python (script workflow, ví dụ .shared/ui-ux-pro-max)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.pyo
.Python
**/venv/
**/.venv/
**/env/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IDE & plugin / tooling local — không push cấu hình máy cá nhân
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Cursor — workspace/agent local (muốn version rules chung có thể: git add -f .cursor/rules)
**/.cursor/

# Local shared tooling (workflow / ui-ux scripts) — không đẩy repo
**/.shared/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/ehthumbs.db
**/Desktop.ini

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Temp
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/tmp/
**/temp/
**/*.tmp

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Superpowers agent specs/plans (local design docs — not versioned)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
docs/superpowers/
docs/**

# Versioned platform / architecture docs (exceptions)
!docs/PROGRESS.md
!docs/architecture/
!docs/architecture/**
!docs/adr/
!docs/adr/**
!docs/runbooks/
!docs/runbooks/**
!docs/superpowers/specs/
!docs/superpowers/specs/**
!docs/superpowers/plans/
!docs/superpowers/plans/**
!docs/TRIPBLOGGER_APP_CONTEXT.md

# JWT PEMs and bulky geo data
infra/jwt/*.pem
infra/jwt/*.key

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local project structure map (personal reference — not versioned)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
docs/PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# scripts and .superpowers folder
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
scripts/
.superpowers/